		{
			description: [
				"Alex's Caves is a collection of specialised underground ecosystems. Read the Cave Book and learn the hazards, resources and creatures of one biome before applying habits from another."
				"Carry general expedition supplies plus one empty section of inventory for biome-specific tools. Unfamiliar blocks may be machinery, hazards or living parts of the environment."
