		{
			dependencies: ["3FA29C6849A7329D"]
			description: [
				"Secure oxygen, radiation, darkness, hostile terrain or aggressive wildlife before focusing on valuable blocks. If the environment is killing you, better tools will not solve the route home."
				"Establish a marked staging point outside each cave biome and unload discoveries regularly. Long underground trips become safer when failure loses minutes instead of an entire evening."
				"Bring samples home for research, but resist dismantling the landscape before understanding what depends on it."
				"Each cave has a strong environmental identity and hazard set: radiation, magnetism, deep water, darkness, ancient life, or confectionery physics. Prepare for the named environment instead of taking one universal mining kit."
			]
