		{
			description: [
				"Alex's Caves biomes are deliberately rare. Search ordinary Overworld caves for an Underground Cabin, whose loot can include Cave Tablets and a Cave Compendium."
				"The Compendium contains a section for each cave but begins partly locked. Keep every tablet; its hidden subject is revealed through research rather than by guessing from the texture."
				"Mark the cabin and turn it into a small research station. It is the front door to the mod even though no portal appears there."
				"Tablet fragments become useful through translation and the Compendium. Preserve fragments, read the resulting entry, and craft the correct cave map before generating huge underground areas blindly."
			]
