			description: [
				"Use a Spelunkery Table to translate a Cave Tablet. The resulting Cave Codex unlocks the matching Compendium section and participates in the map-making trail."
				"Read the new section before crafting the Cave Map. It explains mobs, materials and hazards that ordinary coordinates cannot."
				"Store translated codices and spare maps in the archive. A rare clue should support several expeditions rather than vanish with the first player who found it."
