			description: [
				"Luxtructosaurus, Hullbreaker, Tremorzilla, Gum Worm and other apex encounters belong to different caves and are not equivalent milestones. Some require deliberate summoning or unusual conditions."
				"Do not activate a ritual, feed a suspicious catalyst or attack the largest silhouette until the group has read that Compendium section and stored spare gear."
